
## Database Schema

The service uses a comprehensive template data model with the following structure:

### HistoryTemplate
- `id`: Unique template identifier
- `title`: Template title (3-200 characters)
- `description`: Detailed template description
- `era`: Historical era classification
- `dynasty`: Egyptian dynasty number
- `pharaoh_id`: Associated pharaoh identifier
- `difficulty`: Content difficulty level
- `thumbnail_url`: Template preview image
- `language`: Content language (ISO format)
- `is_active`: Publication status
- `version`: Template version number
- `published_at`: Publication timestamp
- `created_at`/`updated_at`: Audit timestamps
- `sections`: Template content sections
- `tags`: Content classification tags

### TemplateSection
- `id`: Section identifier
- `template_id`: Parent template reference
- `title`/`subtitle`: Section headings
- `content_type`: Content format specification
- `content`: Section content data
- `metadata`: Additional section metadata
- `order_index`: Section ordering
- `optional`: Optional section flag
- `created_at`: Section creation timestamp

## API Documentation

### gRPC Service Methods

#### GetTemplateByID
Retrieve a specific template by its unique identifier.
```protobuf
rpc GetTemplateByID(GetTemplateByIDRequest) returns (GetTemplateByIDResponse);
```

#### GetAllTemplates
Retrieve paginated list of all templates with sorting options.
```protobuf
rpc GetAllTemplates(GetAllTemplatesRequest) returns (GetAllTemplatesResponse);
```
**Parameters:**
- `page`: Page number for pagination
- `limit`: Number of results per page
- `sort_by`: Sort field (title, created_at, updated_at)
- `order`: Sort order (asc, desc)

#### GetTemplatesByEra
Retrieve templates from a specific historical era.
```protobuf
rpc GetTemplatesByEra(GetTemplatesByEraRequest) returns (GetTemplatesByEraResponse);
```
**Supported Eras:**
- Old Kingdom
- Middle Kingdom
- New Kingdom
- Late Period
- Ptolemaic Period

#### GetTemplatesByDynasty
Retrieve templates associated with a specific Egyptian dynasty.
```protobuf
rpc GetTemplatesByDynasty(GetTemplatesByDynastyRequest) returns (GetTemplatesByDynastyResponse);
```

#### GetTemplatesByPharaoh
Retrieve templates associated with a specific pharaoh.
```protobuf
rpc GetTemplatesByPharaoh(GetTemplatesByPharaohRequest) returns (GetTemplatesByPharaohResponse);
```

#### GetTemplatesByDifficulty
Retrieve templates by difficulty level.
```protobuf
rpc GetTemplatesByDifficulty(GetTemplatesByDifficultyRequest) returns (GetTemplatesByDifficultyResponse);
```
**Difficulty Levels:**
- beginner: Basic historical concepts
- intermediate: Moderate complexity content
- advanced: Complex historical analysis

#### SearchTemplates
Perform advanced search across template content.
```protobuf
rpc SearchTemplates(SearchTemplatesRequest) returns (SearchTemplatesResponse);
```
**Parameters:**
- `query`: Search term
- `fields`: Fields to search (title, description, content)
- `page`/`limit`: Pagination parameters

#### CreateTemplate
Create a new historical template.
```protobuf
rpc CreateTemplate(CreateTemplateRequest) returns (CreateTemplateResponse);
```

#### UpdateTemplate
Update existing template information.
```protobuf
rpc UpdateTemplate(UpdateTemplateRequest) returns (UpdateTemplateResponse);
```

#### DeleteTemplate
Remove a template from the system.
```protobuf
rpc DeleteTemplate(DeleteTemplateRequest) returns (DeleteTemplateResponse);
```

#### GetTemplatesByTag
Retrieve templates by specific tags.
```protobuf
rpc GetTemplatesByTag(GetTemplatesByTagRequest) returns (GetTemplatesByTagResponse);
```

#### GetRelatedTemplates
Find templates related to a specific template.
```protobuf
rpc GetRelatedTemplates(GetRelatedTemplatesRequest) returns (GetRelatedTemplatesResponse);
```

